{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#921","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#921","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#921\",\"parent_revision\":\"7da09ccc0aeb1bf9016658b956b67c3b072f21d4\",\"root_revision\":\"e42139a663c2a36b6f98e5b1d671018f61880b7b836b2a699df6b254fa78d607\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P0\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild a script or agent capability that reads Impact Radius from all groomed backlog items in a milestone, compares file lists across items, and produces an overlap matrix identifying which items form conflict groups (must execute sequentially) and which are independent (can run in parallel). Output feeds into the dispatch plan generator.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **milestone orchestration: cross-item dependency analysis** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Milestone orchestration design \u2014 .claude/reports/milestone-orchestration-design-20260320.md\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"ccf3fc81594a60169587383065dd7a634fc5dff32efa1fa38b44291d244343cc\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABXN524g\"}"}